    "uz": "Hovuzga har daqiqada 7 litr suv quyiladi. Daqiqa oxirida hovuz hali to'lmagan bo'lsa, 2 litr suv oqib ketadi. Hovuz sig'imi (litr) kiritiladi. Necha daqiqada to'lishini chiqaring.",
    "en": "7 litres of water are poured into a pool every minute. If the pool is not yet full at the end of a minute, 2 litres leak out. The capacity (litres) is entered. Print how many minutes until it is full."
   },
