    "uz": "Shahar aholisi P kishi va har yili 10% ga ko'payadi. Avval P, keyin maqsad T kiritiladi. Necha yildan keyin aholi soni T ga yetadi yoki undan oshadi?",
    "en": "A city has P people and grows 10% every year. P is entered first, then the target T. After how many years does the population reach or exceed T?"
   },
